# Saarathi reads no secrets from this file. Provider CLIs keep their own logins.
# Variables Saarathi itself understands:

# Where worktrees are created (default: the platform user data directory).
# SAARATHI_DATA_DIR=/path/to/data

# Test-only: allow the scripted fake adapter. Never set this for real work.
# SAARATHI_ALLOW_FAKE_PROVIDERS=1

# Opt in to live provider tests (uses a small amount of quota).
# SAARATHI_LIVE_TESTS=1
# SAARATHI_CODEX_BIN=/path/to/codex

# API keys are NOT passed to workers unless listed in execution.env_passthrough in
# .saarathi/policies.yaml, and metered use stays blocked while billing.api_enabled is false.
